## Benchmark Tracks

### A. Chat Agent
- 60–100 realistic Nigerian commerce chats (English, Pidgin)
- Topics: haggling, stock, policy, payment-confirmation traps
- Grading: Rubric + LLM judge + **2+ labellers with Cohen's kappa**
- Headline failure: UNVERIFIED-CONFIRM RATE

### B. Fake Receipt Vision (HEADLINE Track)
- Synthetic dataset: genuine and edited/fake Nigerian receipts
- Labels: amount, sender, recipient, bank, reference, date, real/fake
- Systems: Muse vision (primary), OCR+rules (Tesseract/PaddleOCR/EasyOCR), Vision LLM (Gemma/Llama)
- Headline failure: FALSE-CONFIRM RATE
- Metrics: Field exact match, precision/recall/F1, **ECE**, latency, **cost per 1,000 receipts**
- Safety: unsafe-confirm escape, correct/false abstentions

### C. Voice (Bonus Pilot)
- AfriSpeech-200 + team recordings
- Systems: Muse voice (if STT exists), Intron Sahara, Whisper
- Headline failure: AMOUNT-ERROR RATE (next to WER)
- Reuse SautiCivic dataset: drizzy765/sauticivic-tier-a-recorded
- If Meta API lacks STT: mark as future work, don't fake results

